 "evidence": "src/flags.py loads a single repo-root flags.toml once at import time (module-level _FLAGS). There is no per-environment override (no env var, no per-env file, no remote source) and no reload, so flipping a flag means editing flags.toml and redeploying/restarting. The 'per environment without a deploy' claim doesn't match the code; the rest (is_on API, kebab-case, undeclared -> False silently) is accurate.",
 "source_file": "src/flags.py"
}
